# Digital Road Network

This module converts the initial FloodPath road map into a digital graph.

## Representation

- Nodes represent locations/intersections.
- Edges represent roads connecting those locations.
- Road weights are not assigned yet; they will be added in the flood-risk weighting stage.

## Nodes

A, B, N, S, L

## Roads

- A - B
- N - S
- N - L
- S - L

## Purpose

This graph will later be converted into a weighted road network and used by A* Search for evacuation routing.
